                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This assumption that people on Medicaid don\u2019t want to work is just wrong.\n\nFor folks like my constituent Emmanuel, Medicaid is the lifeline they need to get and hold a job.\n\nThe best health care is health care.",
