                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For countless Delawareans and folks across the country, Medicaid plays a vital role in everyday life.\n\nThis month, I called Emmanuel - who is able to work and pay rent thanks to Medicaid - and Nancy - whose son relies on Medicaid for long-term care - to hear their stories. https://t.co/lAanaak75L",
