                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Constituents have told me how Medicaid empowers them to hold jobs, live normal lives, and participate as full members of society. \n\nThey\u2019re not going to just \u201cget over it.\u201d\n\nWhen we hear from people back home about policies we\u2019re voting on, our job is to listen.",
