                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For so many across the country on Medicaid, @PPFA  means access to reproductive care, cancer screenings, STD testing and treatment, and much more.\n\nThis disastrous ruling is going to cut millions of Americans off from the care they need.",
