                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This administration knows that elderly medicaid recipients aren't coming out of retirement to work on farms and in meat-packing facilities.\n\nTheir cruel immigration crackdown is creating a labor shortage, and it's raising everyday costs for you and your family.",
