                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Thanks to President Trump & Congressional Republicans, a 55-year-old earning nearly $63,000/year in Delaware could see their annual health insurance premiums rise by an average of $5,780.\n\nI don\u2019t know about you, but I want Delawareans to pay less for their healthcare, not more.",
