                "text": "Bad news: Delawareans who get their health insurance on the marketplace will be paying higher rates this coming year - the highest since the last time President Trump was in office.\n\nAnd it\u2019s directly because of actions taken by the Trump administration.\nhttps://t.co/7G1jtTYzEa",
