                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Nothing about kicking millions off their health insurance, supercharging vaccine skepticism, or letting care costs skyrocket is \u2018making America healthy again\u2019.\n\nThis administration has been a disaster for our nation\u2019s health, and RFK Jr has been at the head.\n\nHe needs to resign.",
